unty","/arc-plc/north-carolina/buncombe-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, November to December ended at 38% of normal on the middle, and October to November at 59%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 43% and March to April at 42% on the middle.</p>"}
